      "repair": "The browser deck slab in poniatowski-browser-model.mjs build() was lofted from a bottom-first ring, so the whole slab faced inward and the strip between roadway and fascia showed the deck underside 0.7 m below. Its roadway, soffit and end faces are now emitted outward as explicit quads with the same diagonals. The two long sides deliberately keep their inward winding: the red fascia beams sit 1 cm inside the slab edge (outer face at z=±12.39 against the slab at ±12.4) and outward sides would hide them. A full fix needs the fascia moved about 1 cm outward, which is left to the owner. The original master deck in poniatowski-bridge-model.mjs was already wound correctly.",
